  "html": "<div id=\"step-q98631\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q98631\" questionid=\"98631\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 3</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Find the domain of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"26\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D460 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mroot space=\"4\"><mjx-root style=\"vertical-align: 0.426em; width: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"ss\" style=\"padding-left: 0.524em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-root><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.128em;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mrow></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-mroot><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stret